{"1546880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Alone Astro Miner", "steam_appid": 1546880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT HAPPENS WHEN…</strong><br>You awaken to a familiar voice, yet unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what you are and what your tasks are - but not why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a freshly employed mining drone, awakened from an eternal sleep, and sent to harvest resources and maintain operations in deep space for the <strong>Trygvesson-Brone Mining Industries</strong> mega-corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your employer is very hands-off. Will you stick to your programming or go off-script to discover what’s really out there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/58cb52c0d431cd7885264991b0b3f941.poster.avif?t=1782380407\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/58cb52c0d431cd7885264991b0b3f941.webm?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/58cb52c0d431cd7885264991b0b3f941.mp4?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and mine valuable resources, upgrade your capabilities, and go up the ranks of your corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with efficiency - learn how to maximize your limited time per shift, or ignore your duties entirely; only one way to find out what the consequences are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/a44c5e1c047c0655b958005fa10185cb.poster.avif?t=1782380407\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/a44c5e1c047c0655b958005fa10185cb.webm?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/a44c5e1c047c0655b958005fa10185cb.mp4?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/1ceafc6f07987b69d3b869550323a3c6.poster.avif?t=1782380407\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/1ceafc6f07987b69d3b869550323a3c6.webm?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/1ceafc6f07987b69d3b869550323a3c6.mp4?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned space debris, asteroid belts, and relics of a history lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover strange signs of the past and hidden truths buried in the void to understand your present and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/53e69b551d0c0bc4d63514ed5782b024.poster.avif?t=1782380407\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/53e69b551d0c0bc4d63514ed5782b024.webm?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/53e69b551d0c0bc4d63514ed5782b024.mp4?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore – Enjoy immersive, mining gameplay at your own pace.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking Space Vistas – Soak in the beauty of the Solar System, distant planets, and vast asteroid fields.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Resource Variety – Mine multiple ores, with unique approaches to become the best at your craft.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Asteroid Fields – Travel across varied asteroid fields within the Solar System, each with its own challenges and secrets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Upgrades – Enhance your equipment, making you more efficient and providing more time to explore.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths – Discover secret locations and rare anomalies hidden within the asteroid fields.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Narrative – Shape your fate through storylines and decisions that affect your standing.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT HAPPENS WHEN…</strong><br>You awaken to a familiar voice, yet unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what you are and what your tasks are - but not why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a freshly employed mining drone, awakened from an eternal sleep, and sent to harvest resources and maintain operations in deep space for the <strong>Trygvesson-Brone Mining Industries</strong> mega-corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your employer is very hands-off. Will you stick to your programming or go off-script to discover what’s really out there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/58cb52c0d431cd7885264991b0b3f941.poster.avif?t=1782380407\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/58cb52c0d431cd7885264991b0b3f941.webm?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/58cb52c0d431cd7885264991b0b3f941.mp4?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and mine valuable resources, upgrade your capabilities, and go up the ranks of your corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with efficiency - learn how to maximize your limited time per shift, or ignore your duties entirely; only one way to find out what the consequences are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/a44c5e1c047c0655b958005fa10185cb.poster.avif?t=1782380407\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/a44c5e1c047c0655b958005fa10185cb.webm?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/extras/a44c5e1c047c0655b958005fa10185cb.mp4?t=1782380407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=