r System, distant planets, and vast asteroid fields.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Resource Variety – Mine multiple ores, with unique approaches to become the best at your craft.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Asteroid Fields – Travel across varied asteroid fields within the Solar System, each with its own challenges and secrets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Upgrades – Enhance your equipment, making you more efficient and providing more time to explore.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths – Discover secret locations and rare anomalies hidden within the asteroid fields.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Driven Narrative – Shape your fate through storylines and decisions that affect your standing.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play as a mining drone in an AI-run megacorporation, long after humanity vanished. Journey across the Solar System, harvest ore, and upgrade your equipment. Between stretches of work, discover hidden locations and decide: will you follow routine, or venture into the unknown?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/0e04b10e8797547a4e7ffd4c9c06a7342eceeee9/header.jpg?t=1782380407", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/8dac486138b73e097b98b641d9059b2b20333515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782380407", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546880/8dac486138b73e097b98b641d9059b2b20333515/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782380407", "website": "https://www.helskorgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operat